# apps/web/out/ is deliberately NOT ignored.
# Hostinger runs no build step — its deployment only runs `npm ci` and then
# serves the committed apps/web/out/ directory verbatim. The static export is
# therefore a build artifact that must be committed, or the site never updates.
# See docs/runbooks/HOSTINGER_DEPLOYMENT.md.
